maluos-session (0.6.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 12 slice 8, the Agents app: the office's agents (maluctl office
    agents) in the state as office.agents after each heartbeat; the agent
    icons synced through `maluos-agents --sync` whenever the set of agents
    changes; com.maluos.Agents.desktop pinned in the dock.

